			"notes": "KoreanChat 1.8 adds NeoForge support for Minecraft 26.3 and keeps the Fabric 26.3 build.\n\n- Fabric: KoreanChat-1.8.jar (requires Fabric API; bundles Player Data API).\n- NeoForge: KoreanChat-neoforge-1.8.jar (requires NeoForge 26.3.0.23-beta or newer for Minecraft 26.3).\n- NeoForge stores /krc settings in player persistent data. Existing Fabric Player Data API settings are not imported automatically.\n\nBoth builds passed Gradle. The NeoForge 26.3 development server loaded KoreanChat 1.8 and reached Done; client chat behavior was not exercised."
		},
